cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DualC, please credit it as below."
title: "DualC"
abstract: >-
  A C++17 dual-contouring library: triangle meshes and real-valued implicit
  fields go through a Hermite-data octree and come out as clean triangle meshes,
  sharp features preserved.
type: software
